# sztest --pipe cue sheet: frame  Parameter Name  value (60 fps, 120 BPM from --bpm)
# Options and events step; everything else ramps between its keys, so a jump
# is two keys a frame apart.

# 0-4 s: the defaults. A knife edge, a little out of focus. (A track holds its
# first key's value from frame 0, so every track starts at its default here.)
0 Optics 0
0 Pulse 0
0 Walls 0
0 Fire On 0

# 4-7 s: colour schlieren, with some of the bare field mixed in.
240 Optics 1
240 Grey Field 0
241 Grey Field 0.5
240 Distance 0.294
241 Distance 0

# 7-10 s: a shadowgraph on a screen 1 km off, over the bare grey field.
419 Distance 0
419 Grey Field 0.5
420 Grey Field 1
420 Optics 2
420 Distance 0.5

# 10-13 s: Blasts, loud enough to crack, through a focused knife.
599 Grey Field 1
600 Grey Field 0.35
600 Optics 0
599 Distance 0.5
600 Distance 0
599 Loudness 0.6429
600 Loudness 0.85
599 Pulse 0
600 Pulse 2

# 13-17 s: a box of walls from a speaker in the corner, on quavers, the clip as a backdrop 1.6 km off.
779 Loudness 0.85
780 Loudness 0.6429
780 Pulse 0
780 Walls 2
780 Fire On 1
779 Speaker X 0.5
780 Speaker X 0.3
779 Speaker Y 0.5
780 Speaker Y 0.3
780 Optics 3
779 Distance 0
780 Distance 0.55
779 Grey Field 0.35
780 Grey Field 0
1019 Distance 0.55
